      "writtenOn": "2021-03-18T15:12:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The requirements wrt power-up tests are the same for FIPS and NIAP: NIAP copied parts of FIPS. Initially, Pixels were only NIAP-compliant, as it is a more sensible and simple certification. So the NIAP naming is a historical artefact. I can rename all to FIPS 140-2/3 if everyone agrees that it makes more sense?",
      "parentUuid": "8fbc27c6_1b0ffda0",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 11,
        "startChar": 50,
        "endLine": 12,
        "endChar": 20
      },
      "revId": "79b5e3de99d315b7be8ab2206915f31a405c4d2c",
