      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-03-18T20:15:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I don\u0027t know which name makes more sense.  Maybe combine both: CONFIG_CRYPTO_NIAP_FIPS_SELFTESTS.  Either way, please properly describe the purpose of these tests in the commit messages, comments, Kconfig help text, etc.  If they are intended to comply with both NIAP and FIPS, then both should be mentioned, not just NIAP.",
      "parentUuid": "adb7c4c3_c3d44bbd",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 11,
        "startChar": 50,
        "endLine": 12,
        "endChar": 20
